{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53595","headline":"咏廿四气诗 大雪十一月节 · 元稹","name":"咏廿四气诗 大雪十一月节","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积阴成大雪，看处乱霏霏。\n玉管鸣寒夜，披书晓绦帷。\n黄钟随气改，鷃鸟不鸣时。\n何限苍生类，依依惜暮晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}